Winter buildings (assets/winter.bin)
====================================

The fifty buildings played out at sea are adapted from the main set of generated
levels published with the work "Utilizing Generative Adversarial Networks for
Stable Structure Generation in Angry Birds", (c) 2023 Frederic Abraham, Mathew
Stephenson, licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0).

  Source:  https://github.com/Blaxzter/Utilizing-Generative-Adversarial-Networks-for-Stable-Structure-Generation-in-Angry-Birds/tree/main/generated_levels/main_set
           (commit c803c18be10c96f029a62ee6df58aa94224e61f7)
  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes made: fifty of the eight thousand levels were chosen, numbers
  1528 1125 6532 6159 5553 5578 4580 437 7412 7184 6484 3045 3692 7762
  3545 1069 978 6970 5106 6871 265 6091 1026 2975 3394 3525 2545 5805 6885
  1755 2015 6775 4762 6248 3669 6651 1776 4841 2306 3840 5383 5104 1940
  2751 1715 288 7842 2002 5355 6006
in the order they are played. Targets, birds, slingshot and camera were removed.
The flat blocks were given a depth of 0.48 m, scaled down where needed to fit the
plinth, narrowed by 5 cm so neighbours do not overlap, and each laid exactly on what
is under it; then tested for standing in this game's physics, both as they are and
mirrored, and ordered from easy to stubborn by one test throw. In play they come
round again after the fiftieth, mirrored on every other pass.

